Z||000000||87ECO5||10-09-2000||09:14 AM||||If you want your Fiero in the 2001 PFF calendar, start sending photos to -  <A HREF="mailto:Fiero87EC5@aol.com">Fiero87EC5@aol.com</A> <P>Also send some information:  specifics of your car (year, model, etc.), your name and whether or not you want it (or your PFF username) tagged with the photo, and anything else you want to go with it.<P>I can also scan photos if you don't have a scanner or digital camera.  Just email me and we can make arrangements.<P>I still don't have every detail nailed down yet but I'll keep you posted ...||||reg||1
