Z||000006||87ECO5||10-10-2000||10:15 AM||||I've received some nice photos but I need more, everyone!  I want engine and interior shots too this year.  It doesn't cost a dime to get your car submitted and, hey!, I don't care if it's not show quality!  If you're proud of your car, then it needs to be displayed in this calendar!<P>I've got about 50 slots to fill and I only have 8 so far.  I'll continue to accept photos through the end of October (or until I fill all 50 slots - whichever comes first).  I hope to have a price nailed down around the same time.  I also hope to have it ready for purchase by the beginning of December.<P>Stay tuned to this thread for updates.<P><B>fiero56</B> - you, sir, need to be sending me a photo … Mr. Instigator!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||14
